      <title>燃油车“回光返照”？丰田豪掷9.12亿美元，美国混动市场是“新蓝海”还是“老牌坚守”？</title>
      <link>https://johhhhnny.github.io/TeslaDaily/posts/20251118-%E7%87%83%E6%B2%B9%E8%BD%A6%E5%9B%9E%E5%85%89%E8%BF%94%E7%85%A7%E4%B8%B0%E7%94%B0%E8%B1%AA%E6%8E%B7912%E4%BA%BF%E7%BE%8E%E5%85%83%E7%BE%8E%E5%9B%BD%E6%B7%B7%E5%8A%A8%E5%B8%82%E5%9C%BA%E6%98%AF%E6%96%B0%E8%93%9D%E6%B5%B7%E8%BF%98%E6%98%AF%E8%80%81%E7%89%8C%E5%9D%9A%E5%AE%88/</link>
